  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>UVDelta 83 (Urgences Vétérinaires Delta 83), in Puget-sur-Argens, is a practice entirely dedicated to veterinary emergencies: not a regular clinic, but a team organised around emergencies, resuscitation and intensive care. Its website states that it has moved to ZAC Les Meissugues, 19 Les Barestes.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The practice is not open around the clock: according to its website, it receives patients at night Monday to Friday from 7pm to 8am, from Saturday 12pm to Monday 8am, and on public holidays from 7pm the day before until 8am the next day. During the day on weekdays it is closed: you then need to go through your usual vet or an open clinic. The emergency number is 04 89 88 34 34.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: save this number on your phone as soon as you arrive in the Var, and call before heading over so the team can get ready to receive your dog.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Puget-sur-Argens is right next to Fréjus, easily reached from the motorway.</p>
